== Overview == 
The [[Magnet Titan Toilet]] is a boss toilet appearing in the [[Time Factory]] and [[Drill Forest]], with a health of 16,700,000. It is the boss of the mode, appearing in the last wave, 50.
== Health ==
Wave 50 [[Time Factory]]: 16.7M (16,700,000)

Wave 50 [[Drill Forest]]: 16.7M (16,700,000)

Wave 1: 2,000,000
== Strategies ==
* In reality, it is not a really hard [[Enemies|Toilet]] to defeat. The best method is by using 15 [[Guardian Clockman]] (Time Factory) (It is easy to get) because this unit does high damage, high range, and it slows toilets by 60%. You can also use other high dps units.
* for [[Drill Forest]], Use units such as [[Large Drillman]] or [[Armored Drillman]] to get most of its HP. you can also use [[Dark Drillman]] and [[Drillwoman]] along with [[Corporal Drillman]] or [[Sergeant Drillman]] for the quickest kill.
* You can also use the sell and place method, this method is getting some [[Units]] attacking the toilet, and when the toilet is out of their range you sell them and places your troops in the range again.
* In the [https://dom-studios-skibidi-multiverse.fandom.com/wiki/DOM_Studio%27s_Skibidi_Multiverse_Wiki Skibidi Toilet Multiverse series], his toilet has red, blue, and silver colors, but in the game, he is golden.


